"account and obtaining the information necessary to integrate with "
"|morpheus|. Continue to the next section for a detailed look at enabling "
"the APIs mentioned above."
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/google/google.rst:42
msgid "Enabling the Required APIs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/google/google.rst:44
msgid ""
"In order to take full advantage of the |morpheus| integration with Google"
" Cloud, a number of APIs must be enabled within the GCP web console. It's"
" recommended that you enable all of the APIs listed in the preceding "
"section regardless of the |morpheus| feature set you intend to use. This "
"will ensure you do not run into problems down the road stemming from a "
"lack of access which may take time to diagnose."
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/google/google.rst:46
msgid ""
"Log into the Google Cloud web console and navigate to the APIs and "
"Services page. You may find this in the Quick access area of the welcome "
"page or you can search for it as shown in the screenshot below."
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/google/google.rst:48
msgid ".. image:: /images/integration_guides/clouds/gcp/apis.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/google/google.rst:50
msgid ""
"From the APIs and Services page, a list of enabled APIs and some details "
"about your usage are shown. To enable new APIs, click :guilabel:`+ ENABLE"
" APIS & SERVICES` near the top of the window. Now on the API library "
"page, search for the API you wish to enable. Here I've searched for the "
"Kubernetes Engine API."
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/google/google.rst:52
msgid ".. image:: /images/integration_guides/clouds/gcp/apisearch.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/google/google.rst:54
msgid ""
"From the search results, click on the API you wish to enable to view its "
"detail page. Click :guilabel:`ENABLE`. Once successfully enabled, the "
"button will change to a :guilabel:`MANAGE` button. It may take a few "
"moments for the API to be fully enabled. You may also be prompted to "
"enable the Cloud Billing API or create an association with a Billing "
"Account when enabling APIs. Go ahead and do so if prompted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/google/google.rst:56
msgid ".. image:: /images/integration_guides/clouds/gcp/apienable.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/google/google.rst:58
msgid ""
"Repeat this process until all required APIs (listed in the previous "
"section) are enabled."
msgstr ""

